#: ../../source/pump_README.md:13
msgid ""
"When using standard `source.pipe(dest)` source will _not_ be destroyed if"
" dest emits close or an error. You are also not able to provide a "
"callback to tell when then pipe has finished."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/pump_README.md:16
msgid "pump does these two things for you"
msgstr ""

