msgid "Usage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/pump_README.md:20
msgid ""
"Simply pass the streams you want to pipe together to pump and add an "
"optional callback"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/pump_README.md:38
msgid "You can use pump to pipe more than two streams together as well"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/pump_README.md:48
msgid ""
"If `source`, `transform`, `anotherTransform` or `dest` closes all of them"
" will be destroyed."
msgstr ""

